Partner logos for the marquee on index.html. 17 files, exact names:

  airport-associates.png
  grotta.png
  holaskoli.jpeg      <- .jpeg, not .jpg
  hotel-burfell.png
  hotel-dyrholaey.png
  icelandair.png
  ir.gif
  islandshotel.png
  kr.png
  macron.jpg
  nordic-hostel.gif
  orkan.png
  reykjalundur.png
  sa.png              <- Samtok atvinnulifsins, still missing
  skjol.jpg
  taekniskolinn.png
  valur.png           <- still missing

The names and extensions are referenced literally in index.html, and each one
carries a per-logo flag there: class="ag-mul" for logos delivered on a white
rectangle, class="ag-inv" on the tile for white or light logos that would
vanish on cream (orkan, nordic-hostel, macron). Renaming a file silently
breaks its tile, so keep the names as they are.

/assets/* is served with Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable.
That means a replaced file keeps serving the old version from browser caches.
To swap a logo, give the new file a different name and update the reference
in index.html.

Delete this file once all 17 are here.
